# This is a sample file of tab separated translations from foreign film titles to their English equivalents
#
# Create a similar file for titles you want translated, with any name and extension.
# Pass it as a -t parameter to makeIMDbFromFiles.sh, i.e. ./makeIMDbFromFiles.sh -t MyShows.xlate

# Don't use this to map tvEpisode titles to their parent tvSeries. To include a single
# episode, list it in a .tconst file and translate its own title here.

35 Diwrnod	35 Days
Crime	Irvine Welsh's Crime
Murder Is Easy	Agatha Christie's Murder is Easy
Poirot	Agatha Christie's Poirot
Retribution	One of Us
Shakespeare & Hathaway: Private Investigators	Shakespeare & Hathaway - Private Investigators
The Pale Horse	Agatha Christie: The Pale Horse
The Pembrokeshire Murders: Catching the Gameshow Killer	The Pembrokeshire Murders: Catching the Game Show Killer
Towards Zero	Agatha Christie's Towards Zero
